  "Scope": "Fixed dc55e585 -\u003E0ed1f519. Ten equal-result public Core/PCRE2 cases: unchanged Count and text/native Replace controls, six native caller-destination before/after operations and new funded-owner lanes. New funded API has no funded baseline: its cost is a feature observation against existing unfunded calls. All substitution rows use a live token; finite rows retain all numeric limits. Existing literal/global/detailed/Extended drivers and byte APIs, no host decoding. Cold32 distinct same-size ${1}/$001 keys expand identically, allowing complete destination batches to be checked after timing without timed copies. Compilation/setup excluded; complete operation and synchronous refund included, using lightweight atomic program/working host counters. Warm1.5s/min1000calls/lane, independent80ms calibration,3alternating samples,all\u003E=20ms. One120s cap; at most one focused noise confirmation. No reopened native-parser campaign, catalog, cumulative or package claim.",
